{
    "title": "Netflix Stories",
    "description": "NETFLIX MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED.\r\n\r\nFind adventure in \"Outer Banks,\" romance with \u201cEmily in Paris,\u201d or unexpected choices in the \u201cLove Is Blind\u201d pods. Between \u201cPerfect Match\u201d shenanigans and \u201cSelling Sunset\u201d drama, there are so many options in this collection \u2014 which story will you choose? You\u2019re the main character in this interactive story game featuring an array of stories based on Netflix's hit shows and films. \r\n\r\n\"Netflix Stories\" is a growing library of adventures ready anytime, anywhere. New stories from your favorite shows and movies will be added frequently, so there will be many more adventures to explore!\r\n\r\nONE GAME, MANY POSSIBILITIES \u2014 CHOOSE FROM A COLLECTION OF INTERACTIVE STORIES BASED ON HIT NETFLIX SHOWS AND MOVIES: \r\n\r\nGET SWEPT AWAY BY AN \"OUTER BANKS\" ADVENTURE\r\n\r\n\"Outer Banks\" \u2014 Join the Pogues where it all began. A search for your missing father becomes the adventure of a lifetime as you dive into a mystery and find unexpected romance. Race against rivals as you, John B, Sarah and the Pogues hunt for a lost treasure. When you're part of this crew, every choice is worth its weight in gold.\r\n\r\nFIND ROMANCE WITH \"EMILY IN PARIS\"\r\n\r\n\"Emily in Paris\" \u2014 Say \u201coui\u201d to possibility as you follow your heart in the City of Love. Arriving in Paris to start the job of a lifetime, you'll discover new friends, new challenges and no shortage of eligible suitors. Every decision you make will lead you closer to the top of the fashion industry\u2026 or deeper into romance.\r\n\r\nRISE TO THE TOP IN \"SELLING SUNSET\"\r\n\r\n\"Selling Sunset\" \u2014 As the Oppenheim Group's newest agent, you'll need to sell your way up to win a dream LA listing while navigating demanding clients, office drama and cutthroat competition. Do you really have what it takes to make it in the city of the rich and famous?\r\n\r\nDATING DRAMA IN \"PERFECT MATCH\"\r\n\r\n\"Perfect Match\" \u2014 Create your dream character and date anyone who catches your eye. Find romance (or break hearts) in this dating competition simulation inspired by the sultry and strategic reality series. Will you choose love, power or chaos? \r\n\r\nMORE ABOUT \"NETFLIX STORIES\"\r\n\r\n\"Netflix Stories\" puts you in the center of the action, where you can interact with characters from your favorite shows and movies and influence how each narrative unfolds. Choose a story and dive in.\r\n\r\nCustomize your character, choose your story \u2014 love, romance or drama \u2014 and make choices that are right for you. Welcome to the interactive world of \"Netflix Stories.\" \r\n\r\n- Created by Boss Fight, a Netflix Game Studio.",
    "descriptionHTML": "NETFLIX MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED.<br><br>Find adventure in &quot;Outer Banks,&quot; romance with \u201cEmily in Paris,\u201d or unexpected choices in the \u201cLove Is Blind\u201d pods. Between \u201cPerfect Match\u201d shenanigans and \u201cSelling Sunset\u201d drama, there are so many options in this collection \u2014 which story will you choose? You\u2019re the main character in this interactive story game featuring an array of stories based on Netflix&#39;s hit shows and films. <br><br>&quot;Netflix Stories&quot; is a growing library of adventures ready anytime, anywhere. New stories from your favorite shows and movies will be added frequently, so there will be many more adventures to explore!<br><br>ONE GAME, MANY POSSIBILITIES \u2014 CHOOSE FROM A COLLECTION OF INTERACTIVE STORIES BASED ON HIT NETFLIX SHOWS AND MOVIES: <br><br>GET SWEPT AWAY BY AN &quot;OUTER BANKS&quot; ADVENTURE<br><br>&quot;Outer Banks&quot; \u2014 Join the Pogues where it all began. A search for your missing father becomes the adventure of a lifetime as you dive into a mystery and find unexpected romance. Race against rivals as you, John B, Sarah and the Pogues hunt for a lost treasure. When you&#39;re part of this crew, every choice is worth its weight in gold.<br><br>FIND ROMANCE WITH &quot;EMILY IN PARIS&quot;<br><br>&quot;Emily in Paris&quot; \u2014 Say \u201coui\u201d to possibility as you follow your heart in the City of Love. Arriving in Paris to start the job of a lifetime, you&#39;ll discover new friends, new challenges and no shortage of eligible suitors. Every decision you make will lead you closer to the top of the fashion industry\u2026 or deeper into romance.<br><br>RISE TO THE TOP IN &quot;SELLING SUNSET&quot;<br><br>&quot;Selling Sunset&quot; \u2014 As the Oppenheim Group&#39;s newest agent, you&#39;ll need to sell your way up to win a dream LA listing while navigating demanding clients, office drama and cutthroat competition. Do you really have what it takes to make it in the city of the rich and famous?<br><br>DATING DRAMA IN &quot;PERFECT MATCH&quot;<br><br>&quot;Perfect Match&quot; \u2014 Create your dream character and date anyone who catches your eye. Find romance (or break hearts) in this dating competition simulation inspired by the sultry and strategic reality series. Will you choose love, power or chaos? <br><br>MORE ABOUT &quot;NETFLIX STORIES&quot;<br><br>&quot;Netflix Stories&quot; puts you in the center of the action, where you can interact with characters from your favorite shows and movies and influence how each narrative unfolds. Choose a story and dive in.<br><br>Customize your character, choose your story \u2014 love, romance or drama \u2014 and make choices that are right for you. Welcome to the interactive world of &quot;Netflix Stories.&quot; <br><br>- Created by Boss Fight, a Netflix Game Studio.",
